{
  "id": 218702031,
  "iid": 10389,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "ilp, ulp: don't use the over-TCP dissector for media types.",
  "description": "\"Over TCP\" dissectors are usable only over byte-stream protocols, as\nthey have to carve individual PDUs out of a byte stream, doing\nreassembly if necessary; dissectors registered in the media_type\ndissector table get a reassembled PDU handed to them, and all the\nspecial reassembly stuff they do isn't necessary and may cause\ndissection not to work.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2023-04-19T20:39:12.923Z",
  "updated_at": "2023-04-19T21:49:38.117Z",
